#* {{zh-x|自 ^姬 ^漢 以來，眇 焉 悠邈。|Since the '''Zhou''' and Han dynasties, (the tradition of literature) has stretched far and distant.|CL|ref={{lw|zh|蕭統}} {{w|Xiao Tong}Mo}}, {{lang|zh|《文選序》erta}}"Preface to ''{{w|Wen Xuan|Selections of Refined Literature}}''"}}
